                            	  3478: 
                            	  3479:     ; NES palette mirroring & sprite palette remap
                            	  3480:     ; Entry-0 offsets (16,20,24,28) mirror universal BG color → remap to BG
                            	  3481:     ; Non-entry-0 sprite colors → remap to Genesis CRAM palettes 2-3
