02:00040176 00040196        	   213:     dc.l    UpdateMenuCommon1   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0004017A 000401CC        	   214:     dc.l    UpdateMenuCommon2   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
